{"unit_id":"HR2AY__DSH-Plan-Graph#card-zh","repo":"HR2AY/DSH-Plan-Graph","commit":"e7d4919902c5149b26b40246ddc425ae4dbfcdce","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"**DSH Plan Graph**（DSH Web 插件）：把会话消息和工具调用呈现为可交互的流程图。它在会话视图中加入 Plan Graph 标签，并支持画布平移缩放、按轮次分组、隐藏工具节点、跟踪最新节点及查看节点详情。用户可收藏节点、复制节点信息，或从图中定位到对应对话行；也可将图表合并到对话右侧栏。适合需要回看长会话执行轨迹和消息关系的 DSH Web 用户。需由 DSH Web 客户端提供 slots、locale 与 layout 服务；插件本身不声明 API key 或外部账号要求。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.body.js:1854-1894","client.body.js:1240-1430","client.body.js:1508-1568"]}
{"unit_id":"HR2AY__DSH-Plan-Graph#card-en","repo":"HR2AY/DSH-Plan-Graph","commit":"e7d4919902c5149b26b40246ddc425ae4dbfcdce","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Plan Graph renders session messages and tool calls as a flow graph in DSH Web. Its tab supports pan and zoom, turn grouping, tool filtering, and node details. Users can favorite nodes, locate chats, and embed it in the sidebar. It requires DSH Web slots, locale, and layout services.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.body.js:1854-1894","client.body.js:1240-1430","client.body.js:1508-1568"]}
