{"unit_id":"HR2AY__DSH-Plan-Graph#feature-graph","repo":"HR2AY/DSH-Plan-Graph","commit":"e7d4919902c5149b26b40246ddc425ae4dbfcdce","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**DSH Plan Graph** 的功能「会话轨迹图」：把会话消息、工具调用和结果投影为节点与连线，并以可平移缩放的画布展示。打开会话中的 Plan Graph 标签即可查看。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.body.js:357-580"]}
{"unit_id":"HR2AY__DSH-Plan-Graph#feature-turns","repo":"HR2AY/DSH-Plan-Graph","commit":"e7d4919902c5149b26b40246ddc425ae4dbfcdce","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**DSH Plan Graph** 的功能「按轮次分组」：将图中节点按会话轮次分组，帮助用户查看每轮交互的执行轨迹。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.body.js:580-700"]}
{"unit_id":"HR2AY__DSH-Plan-Graph#feature-favorites","repo":"HR2AY/DSH-Plan-Graph","commit":"e7d4919902c5149b26b40246ddc425ae4dbfcdce","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**DSH Plan Graph** 的功能「节点收藏」：从节点菜单或拖拽添加收藏，并按会话保存；点击收藏项可回到对应图节点。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.body.js:207-240"]}
{"unit_id":"HR2AY__DSH-Plan-Graph#feature-locate","repo":"HR2AY/DSH-Plan-Graph","commit":"e7d4919902c5149b26b40246ddc425ae4dbfcdce","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**DSH Plan Graph** 的功能「定位对话行」：按工具调用 ID 或消息序号寻找对应对话行，滚动并高亮；无法定位时回退到图内节点。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.body.js:250-292"]}
